Package: strataLCM
Type: Package
Title: Latent Cluster Mixture Models for Stratum-Specific Covariates
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Tomohiro", "Ohigashi",
    email = "ohigashi@rs.tus.ac.jp", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Fits finite latent cluster mixture models for Bayesian estimation
    of multivariate covariate distributions within predefined strata. The
    mixture components are shared across strata, whereas their mixing weights
    vary by stratum to enable information sharing while allowing distributional
    heterogeneity. Supports continuous and categorical covariates,
    posterior-predictive covariate generation, and diagnostics of support
    through shared mixture components. Markov chain Monte Carlo computations
    use 'RcppArmadillo'.
License: GPL-3
URL: https://github.com/tom-ohigashi/strataLCM
BugReports: https://github.com/tom-ohigashi/strataLCM/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
